      "text": "Sadly, you need to avoid the beautiful library in downtown Austin.\n\nIn fact, many libraries in the city are this way, with unhinged people browsing porn on the computers in front of children.",
      "quote": {
        "author": "AustinJustice",
        "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2092291921720832001/V7lKZFtt_200x200.jpg",
        "created_at_shanghai": "2026-10-21 01:59:02",
